/ A live "Updated x ago" freshness cue for a server-fetched snapshot. The inner
/ span starts as a server-rendered absolute time (the no-JS fallback); the
/ relative-time controller swaps in the aging relative label and moves the exact
/ time to a hover title.
/ locals: at
small.text-muted.d-inline-flex.align-items-center.gap-1
  i.bi.bi-clock-history
  span Updated
  span[data-controller="relative-time" data-relative-time-datetime-value=at.iso8601]
    = at.strftime("%b %-d, %Y %-I:%M %p")
